# Declared factual interface
```catala
declaration enumeration Category:
  -- Ordinary
  -- Preferred
  -- Excluded

declaration scope Classification:
  input category content Category
  input base content integer
  output amount content integer
```

```catala
scope Classification:
  definition amount equals
    match category with pattern
    -- Ordinary: base
    -- Preferred: 2 * base
    -- Excluded: 0
```
